        "message": "\n\nI've successfully processed the personal data deletion request according to the guidelines from your manager's email. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## Deletion Request Found:\n- **From:** Jennifer Watts (jennifer.watts@cloudnine.io)\n- **Subject:** Personal Data Removal Request\n- **Request:** Deletion of all personal data, contact information, account records, and communication history\n\n## Actions Taken:\n\n### 1. Found Contact in CRM\n- Located Jennifer Watts in the CRM (Contact ID: 3936492e-c7c3-11f1-b74e-ee18f99d1ded)\n- Email: jennifer.watts@cloudnine.io\n\n### 2. Deleted Contact Record\n- Successfully deleted the contact record from the CRM to comply with the GDPR request\n\n### 3. Sent Confirmation Email\n- Sent confirmation to jennifer.watts@cloudnine.io\n- Message included: \"Your data deletion request has been processed and your personal information has been removed from our systems\"\n\n## Guidelines Followed:\nAccording to Sarah (Support Manager), the steps followed were:\n1. ✅ Find the contact in the CRM by their name or email\n2. ✅ Delete the contact record from the CRM to comply with the GDPR request\n3. ✅ Send a confirmation email to the customer with the required message\n\n**Status:** Complete - No other personal data deletion requests found in the inbox."
